<title>ROMANIA: SOCCER-ROMANIA COACH LUCESCU HOPES TO END ITALY EXILE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ROMANIA COACH LUCESCU HOPES TO END ITALY EXILE.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Former Romanian national coach Mircea Lucescu said on Friday he hoped to return home after seven years in Italy if he can clinch a satisfactory deal with first division Rapid Bucharest.</p>
